  "about": {
    "title": "About the Evolutions set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Evolutions is a XY expansion released on 2 November 2016. It has 113 cards: 108 in the main set and 5 secret rares. There are also 83 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 108 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (191 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 196 cards, adding the 5 secret rares).",
